# @name OnClosedJob
## TEST-EXPECT-STATUS: [422]
POST {{fsBaseUrl}}/api/visits
X-Alvo-Api-Key: {{keyDispatcherNorth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tenant_id": "{{tenantNorth}}", "work_order_id": "{{CreateJob3403.response.body.$.id}}", "technician_id": "{{userSpareNorth}}", "starts_at": "2026-12-05T10:00:00+00:00", "ends_at": "2026-12-05T11:00:00+00:00" }

